#### **Meeting with Key Stakeholders**
To fulfil the accountability aspect, the Internal Audit Function conducted periodic meetings in 2023 with the BoD (three times) and the Audit Committee (four times) with following agenda:
- progress of the 5-year plan;
- progress of the annual audit plan;
- audit reports;
- status of corrective actions implementation; and
- constraints in implementing its Internal Audit Charter, if any.

#### **Rapat dengan Pemangku Kepentingan Utama**
